3.2 Prebuilt native artifacts — a build-time download that ships

  `rive_native` does NOT ship its native libraries inside the pub package.
  Its `bin/setup.dart` downloads a per-platform artifact archive at build
  time from

      https://rive-flutter-artifacts.rive.app/rive_native_versions/
        <version>/rive_native_artifacts_<platform>.zip

  (a `--build-libraries` flag exists to compile from the vendored
  `runtime/` sources instead; WaveCrux uses the default download path).
  The resulting library is linked into WaveCrux's desktop and mobile
  application bundles, and a WASM build serves the same role on web. It
  therefore ships in every WaveCrux distribution that includes the stage
  widgets.

  Those artifacts embed third-party C/C++ libraries. Rive renames their
  symbols to avoid collisions (see
  `runtime/dependencies/rive_harfbuzz_renames.h`, `rive_png_renames.h`,
  `rive_libjpeg_renames.h`, `rive_yoga_renames.h`), so the embedded
  libraries are not obvious from a plain symbol dump.

  Confirmed present by string and symbol inspection of the shipped
  `android/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/librive_native.so`:

    HarfBuzz    — MIT ("Old MIT" license)
                  https://github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzz
                  Present as `rive_`-prefixed renames (`rive_OT`,
                  `rive_CFF`, `rive__hb_CrapPool`).
    SheenBidi   — Apache-2.0
                  https://github.com/Tehreer/SheenBidi
                  Present as the `SBAlgorithm*` public API.
    libpng      — PNG Reference Library License v2 (SPDX: libpng-2.0)
                  http://www.libpng.org/pub/png/libpng.html
    zlib        — Zlib license
                  https://zlib.net/
    Yoga        — MIT (Meta Platforms, Inc.)
                  https://github.com/facebook/yoga

  Referenced by the vendored premake build scripts under
  `runtime/dependencies/` but NOT confirmed present in the inspected
  artifact — they may be excluded by the shipping build configuration:

    libjpeg     — IJG License          (premake5_libjpeg_v2.lua)
    libwebp     — BSD-3-Clause         (premake5_libwebp_v2.lua)
    miniaudio   — MIT-0 or public domain (premake5_miniaudio_v2.lua)
    GLFW        — Zlib                 (premake5_glfw_v2.lua)
    microprofile / Optick — profiling tooling, editor/dev builds only

  **Verification gap.** The `rive_native` pub package ships only Rive's own
  MIT LICENSE (plus `runtime/LICENSE`, also MIT). Neither carries license
  text for the embedded HarfBuzz, SheenBidi, libpng, zlib, or Yoga code,
  and the downloaded artifact archives carry no license manifest. The
  identifications above are taken from each project's own well-established
  upstream terms plus direct inspection of the binary — NOT from a license
  file present in the distributed artifact. All are permissive and none
  are copyleft, but the attribution obligations of libpng, zlib, HarfBuzz,
  SheenBidi, and Yoga attach to WaveCrux's binary distribution. See §16.


