`~/.cargo/registry/src/*/<name>-<version>/` for Rust crates, and either add
a new section here or extend the relevant existing section.

Watch for two classes of trap that this file has already hit once:

  - A package's LICENSE file may contain MORE THAN ONE grant (see
    `node_preamble` in §8). Read the whole file, not the first line.
  - A package may DOWNLOAD prebuilt native binaries at build time that
    embed third-party code its own LICENSE never mentions (see
    `rive_native` in §3.2). Check for `hook/build.dart`, `bin/setup.dart`,
    and vendored `dependencies/` directories.

